@startuml Telecom Antifraud Login Flow

actor "User" as User #E2F0CB
participant "Mobile App" as MobileApp #C7CEEA
participant "Baraka API" as BarakaApi #FFDAC1
participant "Telecom AF" as TelecomAF #E0BBE4

'Request OTP
User -> MobileApp: Opens application on a new device
MobileApp -> BarakaApi: POST /api/user/login/send-otp
BarakaApi -> BarakaApi: Generate OTP, store OTP hash
BarakaApi -> TelecomAF: POST /api/accounts/v1/sms (templateId = 2)
TelecomAF --> User: Send OTP via SMS gateway
BarakaApi --> MobileApp: 200 OK
MobileApp --> User: Show OTP form

loop until OTP is received
    User -> MobileApp: Presses "Resend OTP"
    MobileApp -> BarakaApi: POST /api/user/login/resend-otp
    BarakaApi -> BarakaApi: Invalidate previous OTP, store new OTP hash
    BarakaApi -> TelecomAF: POST /api/accounts/v1/sms (templateId = 2)
end

'Confirm OTP and fraud verdict
User -> MobileApp: Enters OTP
MobileApp -> TelecomAF: SDK checkFraud (OTP)
MobileApp -> BarakaApi: POST /api/user/login/confirm (OTP)
BarakaApi -> BarakaApi: Validate OTP over stored hash
BarakaApi -> TelecomAF: POST /api/accounts/v1/check-fraud/{requestId}
TelecomAF --> BarakaApi: Return verdict
note left of TelecomAF: Verdict carries verified flag\nand a refusal reason

break verdict.verified == false
    BarakaApi --> MobileApp: Return error message
    MobileApp --> User: Show error message, interrupt flow
end

BarakaApi --> MobileApp: 200 OK
MobileApp -> MobileApp: Perform face verification with MyID
MobileApp -> TelecomAF: SDK confirmFace

@enduml
